Z||000003||Monkeyman||04-02-2000||01:40 PM||||As a former member of the US Armed Forces (Army not Navy), I'm just embarrassed! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif">  To think that some pompous moron with a scrambled egg on his hat would almost make a mistake like that...And to think that the US is the worlds only "superpower".  I'm not scared (yet), but I wonder how many other incidents like that have happened.  What if it was someone with the nuclear missle key?  Can you say, "Armegeddon"????||||reg||1
